1
00:00:00,878 --> 00:00:03,048
(Sheldon:)Excuse me.

2
00:00:03,046 --> 00:00:04,046
(Sheldon:)No one does a better job

3
00:00:04,047 --> 00:00:05,877
(Sheldon:)pretending to be a person
than I do.

4
00:00:06,983 --> 00:00:10,153
(Sheldon:)Siri comes close,
but I know more jokes.

5
00:00:10,154 --> 00:00:12,654
(Howard:)If you don't want to
use dating Web sites,

6
00:00:12,656 --> 00:00:13,986
(Howard:)what do you suggest?

7
00:00:13,991 --> 00:00:16,491
(Sheldon:)Off the top of my head?
Uh, prospective women

8
00:00:16,493 --> 00:00:18,963
(Sheldon:)weed themselves out
in a battle of wits

9
00:00:18,962 --> 00:00:20,492
(Sheldon:)until only one champion remains,

10
00:00:20,497 --> 00:00:23,467
(Sheldon:)she shows up at my door flush
with the thrill of victory,

11
00:00:23,467 --> 00:00:27,537
(Sheldon:)and then sits quietly by my side
while I watch Daredevil.

12
00:00:27,538 --> 00:00:30,838
(Howard:)You seriously think women
would fight for you?

13
00:00:30,841 --> 00:00:34,981
(Sheldon:)People compete for jobs
and trophies... why not me?

14
00:00:34,978 --> 00:00:37,508
(Howard:)He's right... he knows
a lot of jokes.

15
00:00:38,748 --> 00:00:41,188
(Raj:)Yeah... no, but it is
basic human nature.

16
00:00:41,185 --> 00:00:44,985
(Raj:)If we present him as a prize,
maybe they would.

17
00:00:44,988 --> 00:00:46,688
(Howard:)Well, he's smart,

18
00:00:46,690 --> 00:00:48,460
(Howard:)he's a respected
scientist...

19
00:00:48,459 --> 00:00:52,359
And I have
the soulful eyes of a cow.

20
00:00:54,430 --> 00:00:56,500
(Raj:)I don't know
if I'd say you...

21
00:00:56,500 --> 00:00:59,020
(Penny:)Oh.

